    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "08f25fdc-e8c0-446b-8f36-f13bf63ffa70",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide in Malta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Malta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Malta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "7a87a451-2721-44f6-8455-0baeb3a811b1",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFive nights on half board basis at the 4* Victoria Hotel at Sliema, just to the north of Valetta and only 10km from the Airport. Located a five minute walk from the promenade, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and swimming pool and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "b12ad451-febb-4d99-b6ab-52df07d68cce",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESliema\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Valletta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGrand Harbour cruise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Mdina\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECatacombs of St Paul\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChurch of St Mary in Mosta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETemples of Tarxien\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGhar Dalam\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHagar Qim\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIsland of Gozo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Citadel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Ggantija Temples\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "223c2cc6-e0fb-4c8a-b0e0-804f47c914c6",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalazzo Falson, Mdina - within the intimate setting of the former home of Capt Olof Frederick Gollcher OBE (1889-1962) are extraordinary collections of paintings, silver, furniture, jewellery, Oriental rugs, armoury and a remarkable library of over 4,500 books and some highly valuable manuscripts\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseum of Fine Arts - located in a 16th century mansion which once housed the knights of the Order of St John with a fine collection including works by Guido Reni, Jusepe de Ribera and William Turner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECasa Rocca Piccola in Valletta - the only privately owned palace open to the public in the city, it was built over 400 years ago for a knight of Malta, Don Pietro La Rocca, and features modern paintings and ancestral portraits and a network of tunnels cut out from the rock under the house, which were used as bomb shelters in the Second World War\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Malta Experience - an audio-visual show telling the dramatic story of the island\u2019s 7,000 year history that has seen it overcome almost unimaginable odds\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "41ca432a-d544-4bdd-88cd-fdfb78e29544",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Sliema\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Malta from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our guide in our private executive coach to the 4* Victoria Hotel at Sliema.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Valletta \u0026amp; Grand Harbour cruise\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Valletta, the capital city of Malta built by the Knights of St John, taking in the Upper Barrakka Gardens for a panoramic view of the Grand Harbour, the beautiful St John\u2019s Cathedral to see the famous Caravaggio painting \u2018The Beheading of St John\u2019 and the Grandmaster\u2019s Palace, home to the parliament and the offices of the President of Malta \u2013 in the afternoon enjoy a Grand Harbour cruise, taking in the two natural harbours on either side of Valetta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Guided tour of Mdina, Catacombs of St Paul \u0026amp; Church of St Mary in Mosta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Mdina, the ancient capital city of Malta, takes in the defence bastions dating back to the 9th century and St Peter and St Paul\u2019s Cathedral \u2013 continue to Rabat to see the famous Catacombs of St Paul, used in Roman times to bury the dead and as a secret meeting place by early Christians \u2013 the Church of St Mary in Mosta, built in 1860, is renowned for its dome which is the third largest in Europe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Temples of Tarxien, Ghar Dalam \u0026amp; Hagar Qim\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe three Megalithic Temples of Tarxien, first discovered in 1915 and dating back to 3000 BC, are notable for their fine workmanship and decorative carvings \u2013 Ghar Dalam, \u2018the Cave of Darkness\u2019, contains the earliest evidence of human settlement on Malta, some 7,400 years ago \u2013 Hagar Qim is a prehistoric temple overlooking the islet of Filfia, the most southerly point of the Maltese Archipelago.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Island of Gozo, The Citadel \u0026amp; the Ggantija Temples\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFerry from Cirkewwa to the island of Gozo, the legendary abode of the beautiful nymph Calypso, daughter of Atlas \u2013 Calypso\u2019s Cave, commanding breathtaking views of the red sands of Ramla Bay, is thought to be that referred to by Homer in \u2018The Odyssey\u2019 where Calypso kept Odysseus as a \u2018prisoner of love\u2019 for seven years \u2013 at the fortified Citadel in Gozo\u2019s capital, Victoria, we visit St Mary\u2019s Cathedral, erected shortly after the earthquake of 1693 \u2013 the Ggantija Temples is one of the most important archaeological sites in Malta and older than Stonehenge and the Great Pyramids.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Sliema\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning free at leisure before we transfer to the airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
